{
  "_comment": "Cohort registry for the vgtfm pipeline. Trimmed to the ten Visium cohorts the manuscript uses; the TCGA entries of the upstream registry are DeepSpot-generated virtual spatial transcriptomics, not measured data, and are excluded. 'split' is the cohort-level train/val/test assignment baked into the cached merged datasets. 'annotation_col' names the pathologist annotation in the raw .h5ad (null = unannotated, used for representation training only). 'donor_pattern' is a regex whose first group extracts the patient key from a sample id; null means every slide is its own patient. It is used for REPORTING only (the dataset table's donor counts) -- SpotTable.donor, which drives the folds and the donor-level bootstrap, still parses TuPro ids and falls back to the slide id, and changing that would move published numbers. 'citation.accession' and 'citation.bibkey' feed the generated dataset table; bibkey must match a key in the manuscript's .bib, which does not live in this repo.",
